  "duration_s": 460.758621,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "隐姓埋名三十年，女儿喊他叔叔这个失踪的男人造出了核潜艇家人们。今天讲一个失踪了三十年的男人，他消失到什么程度，常年不着家，不能跟任何人说自己在哪在干啥。有一次好不容易回趟家，年幼的女儿已经不认识他了。怯生生的问了一句，叔叔，你是谁？你听听亲闺女，管亲爹叫叔叔。那一刻，这个在核反应堆面前，眉头都不皱一下的硬汉眼泪差点掉下来。他叫彭时录中国核潜艇第一任总设计师他爹，是一九二九年高唱国际歌，走向刑场的革命先烈澎湃。他四岁成孤儿，八岁做大牢，十岁，拖着烂腿爬了十几公里，才捡回一条命。就这么一个从苦水里泡大的人，一辈子只干了两件事。一造核潜艇二建核电站，件件都是让中国挺直腰杆的大事。一九五六年，彭时路在苏联留学正打算毕业回国，陈赓大将把他叫到大使馆。开门见山的讲，中央决定选一批留学生，改行学原子能核动力，你愿意吗？他脱口而出，我愿意。只要祖国需要，我就这一句话，他的人生彻底转向，从此他像核潜艇一样，悄无声息的深浅了。以前就是三十年一九五八年，中央批准研制核潜艇，后来中苏关系破裂，苏联撤。总专家撂下话，没有我们，你们干不成。毛主席拍下一句话，掷地有声，核潜艇一万年也要搞出来，话说的容易，活却难干。一九六五年，代号久的核潜艇攻城上马，彭时路带着几百号人进了四川青衣江畔的深山。对外只说自己搞水电给家里写信，地址永远是成都二百九十一信向。连他的妻子都不知道他在干什么，那条件苦到啥程度，交通不便吃住都在工地，一百八十天见不到太阳，毒蛇蚊虫遍地，都是没有计算机，就靠算盘。计算尺手摇计算器三扳倒连轴算油灯拨到凌晨三点，算盘珠子噼里啪啦响个不停。十几万个核心数据硬是拿人手算了一遍又一遍，草稿纸堆的比人还高，装满三个大铁皮柜，粮食不够吃，挖野菜，啃菜根，没人喊苦。数据算错了，推倒重来，没人抱怨。有人问他，这么大的事儿，你一个人拍板不怕担责任吗？他说怕就不干了，不干中国就永远都会被人掐脖子。对了，功劳算你们的错了，责任算我的，就凭这句错了，责任算我的，大家给他起了个外号，叫澎拍板。一九七零年八月三十日，核潜艇反应堆首次达到满功率，整个深山都沸腾了，可总设计师彭士路已经连续五天五夜没合眼。消息传来的那一刻，他靠在墙角直接昏睡了过去。同年十二月二十六日，中国第一艘核潜艇下水四点六万个零部件全部国产，中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。西方大国。那句再等二十年，被他和他的团队硬生生提前干成了。可这背后是拿命换来一九七四年核潜艇最后调试阶段，彭氏路突发，魏川孔倒在了工位上。医生切掉了他四分之三的胃，从那以后，他兜里永远揣着胃药，疼的厉害了，吞两片。接着往工地上跑，八十八岁那年，有记者问他，当年值得吗？他说值得搞成功了，特别高兴，就是死了，也是值得的。核潜艇搞成了他转身又去拓荒中国的核电。大亚湾秦山中国核电站从无到有的每一步都踩着他的脚印。一九八三年，他任大亚湾核电站筹建总指挥，那一年，我国外汇储备才一点六七亿美元，大亚湾要四十亿美元。钱不够，他四处奔波筹资人才，没有他一点点带。后来，他又任秦张二期核电站董事长，从主要参数到投资方案，大到反应堆，小到一颗螺丝钉，他都心中有数。二零一七年九十二岁的他拿到一百万港币的科技大奖，一分钱没往家里拿，权数捐给了国家，用来资助核工业的年轻人。女儿跟他开玩笑，留点给自己嘛，他板起脸，这钱是国家的，我一分都不能动。二零二一年三月，九十六岁的彭时路在北京离世。他的遗嘱里没有半句，家事，只有一个心愿，把我的骨灰撒进大海。我要陪着核潜艇，守着这片海，临终前昏迷的时候，他还在含糊的念叨，参数核对好了吗？家人们，你听听都到生命的最后一口气了，他心里装的还是工作，他这一辈子，小时候老百姓用命护他。长大后，他用命护国造核潜艇、建核电站两件大事，渐渐关系着咱们十四亿人的安稳。你说这样的人是不是该被永远记住？觉得彭老了不起的评论区打深浅一生四个字，致敬这位隐姓埋名一辈子的老人点亮小红心，转发出去，让更多人知道今天我们能挺直腰杆说话。背后就是彭老这样的人，用一辈子在暗处给我们撑伞，点个收藏，讲给孩子听，关注我，往后咱们一起讲更多先辈的故事。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1530,
      "text": "隐姓埋名三十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1790,
      "end_ms": 8070,
      "text": "女儿喊他叔叔这个失踪的男人造出了核潜艇家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8310,
      "end_ms": 11950,
      "text": "今天讲一个失踪了三十年的男人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12990,
      "end_ms": 14590,
      "text": "他消失到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14970,
      "end_ms": 16129,
      "text": "常年不着家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16770,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "不能跟任何人说自己在哪在干啥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00007",
      "start_ms": 21290,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "有一次好不容易回趟家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23830,
      "end_ms": 26310,
      "text": "年幼的女儿已经不认识他了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00009",
      "start_ms": 27110,
      "end_ms": 28770,
      "text": "怯生生的问了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29330,
      "end_ms": 29790,
      "text": "叔叔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30280,
      "end_ms": 30960,
      "text": "你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31360,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "你听听亲闺女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33520,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "管亲爹叫叔叔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00014",
      "start_ms": 35380,
      "end_ms": 36040,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36060,
      "end_ms": 37780,
      "text": "这个在核反应堆面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37800,
      "end_ms": 41740,
      "text": "眉头都不皱一下的硬汉眼泪差点掉下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42380,
      "end_ms": 47540,
      "text": "他叫彭时录中国核潜艇第一任总设计师他爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47920,
      "end_ms": 51140,
      "text": "是一九二九年高唱国际歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51360,
      "end_ms": 54080,
      "text": "走向刑场的革命先烈澎湃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54560,
      "end_ms": 56100,
      "text": "他四岁成孤儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56380,
      "end_ms": 57660,
      "text": "八岁做大牢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58240,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58820,
      "end_ms": 60710,
      "text": "拖着烂腿爬了十几公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60710,
      "end_ms": 61905,
      "text": "才捡回一条命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62720,
      "end_ms": 65215,
      "text": "就这么一个从苦水里泡大的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65590,
      "end_ms": 67665,
      "text": "一辈子只干了两件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68350,
      "end_ms": 74475,
      "text": "一造核潜艇二建核电站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75850,
      "end_ms": 79610,
      "text": "件件都是让中国挺直腰杆的大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79830,
      "end_ms": 80790,
      "text": "一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00030",
      "start_ms": 81010,
      "end_ms": 84625,
      "text": "彭时路在苏联留学正打算毕业回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00031",
      "start_ms": 85230,
      "end_ms": 87385,
      "text": "陈赓大将把他叫到大使馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87860,
      "end_ms": 89115,
      "text": "开门见山的讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00033",
      "start_ms": 89960,
      "end_ms": 92245,
      "text": "中央决定选一批留学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92540,
      "end_ms": 94315,
      "text": "改行学原子能核动力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94820,
      "end_ms": 95740,
      "text": "你愿意吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95820,
      "end_ms": 96775,
      "text": "他脱口而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97240,
      "end_ms": 97885,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98590,
      "end_ms": 100350,
      "text": "只要祖国需要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100350,
      "end_ms": 102070,
      "text": "我就这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102350,
      "end_ms": 104435,
      "text": "他的人生彻底转向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00041",
      "start_ms": 104810,
      "end_ms": 107115,
      "text": "从此他像核潜艇一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00042",
      "start_ms": 107470,
      "end_ms": 109175,
      "text": "悄无声息的深浅了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00043",
      "start_ms": 110000,
      "end_ms": 113435,
      "text": "以前就是三十年一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00044",
      "start_ms": 113740,
      "end_ms": 116075,
      "text": "中央批准研制核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116290,
      "end_ms": 117705,
      "text": "后来中苏关系破裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00046",
      "start_ms": 118370,
      "end_ms": 119010,
      "text": "苏联撤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119010,
      "end_ms": 121050,
      "text": "总专家撂下话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00048",
      "start_ms": 122110,
      "end_ms": 122890,
      "text": "没有我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124170,
      "end_ms": 125050,
      "text": "你们干不成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126510,
      "end_ms": 127930,
      "text": "毛主席拍下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00051",
      "start_ms": 129070,
      "end_ms": 130090,
      "text": "掷地有声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00052",
      "start_ms": 131630,
      "end_ms": 134150,
      "text": "核潜艇一万年也要搞出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00053",
      "start_ms": 134570,
      "end_ms": 135650,
      "text": "话说的容易，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00054",
      "start_ms": 135890,
      "end_ms": 136850,
      "text": "活却难干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00055",
      "start_ms": 137390,
      "end_ms": 138390,
      "text": "一九六五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138730,
      "end_ms": 141330,
      "text": "代号久的核潜艇攻城上马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141750,
      "end_ms": 146470,
      "text": "彭时路带着几百号人进了四川青衣江畔的深山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00058",
      "start_ms": 147070,
      "end_ms": 151220,
      "text": "对外只说自己搞水电给家里写信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00059",
      "start_ms": 151520,
      "end_ms": 155040,
      "text": "地址永远是成都二百九十一信向。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00060",
      "start_ms": 155220,
      "end_ms": 159160,
      "text": "连他的妻子都不知道他在干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00061",
      "start_ms": 160300,
      "end_ms": 162160,
      "text": "那条件苦到啥程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00062",
      "start_ms": 163000,
      "end_ms": 165620,
      "text": "交通不便吃住都在工地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00063",
      "start_ms": 166700,
      "end_ms": 168735,
      "text": "一百八十天见不到太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00064",
      "start_ms": 170980,
      "end_ms": 172480,
      "text": "毒蛇蚊虫遍地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00065",
      "start_ms": 172480,
      "end_ms": 174320,
      "text": "都是没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00066",
      "start_ms": 174560,
      "end_ms": 175440,
      "text": "就靠算盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175620,
      "end_ms": 181720,
      "text": "计算尺手摇计算器三扳倒连轴算油灯拨到凌晨三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00068",
      "start_ms": 181940,
      "end_ms": 184024,
      "text": "算盘珠子噼里啪啦响个不停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184520,
      "end_ms": 189435,
      "text": "十几万个核心数据硬是拿人手算了一遍又一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00070",
      "start_ms": 189970,
      "end_ms": 191905,
      "text": "草稿纸堆的比人还高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00071",
      "start_ms": 192360,
      "end_ms": 194180,
      "text": "装满三个大铁皮柜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00072",
      "start_ms": 194340,
      "end_ms": 195535,
      "text": "粮食不够吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00073",
      "start_ms": 195930,
      "end_ms": 196670,
      "text": "挖野菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00074",
      "start_ms": 196910,
      "end_ms": 197765,
      "text": "啃菜根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00075",
      "start_ms": 198150,
      "end_ms": 199055,
      "text": "没人喊苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00076",
      "start_ms": 199520,
      "end_ms": 200585,
      "text": "数据算错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00077",
      "start_ms": 200860,
      "end_ms": 201700,
      "text": "推倒重来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00078",
      "start_ms": 201880,
      "end_ms": 202825,
      "text": "没人抱怨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00079",
      "start_ms": 203670,
      "end_ms": 204555,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00080",
      "start_ms": 205380,
      "end_ms": 206365,
      "text": "这么大的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00081",
      "start_ms": 206590,
      "end_ms": 209395,
      "text": "你一个人拍板不怕担责任吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00082",
      "start_ms": 210020,
      "end_ms": 212755,
      "text": "他说怕就不干了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00083",
      "start_ms": 214210,
      "end_ms": 217985,
      "text": "不干中国就永远都会被人掐脖子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00084",
      "start_ms": 219170,
      "end_ms": 219590,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00085",
      "start_ms": 220600,
      "end_ms": 223690,
      "text": "功劳算你们的错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00086",
      "start_ms": 225170,
      "end_ms": 226205,
      "text": "责任算我的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00087",
      "start_ms": 228030,
      "end_ms": 231380,
      "text": "就凭这句错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00088",
      "start_ms": 231380,
      "end_ms": 232305,
      "text": "责任算我的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00089",
      "start_ms": 232780,
      "end_ms": 234235,
      "text": "大家给他起了个外号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00090",
      "start_ms": 234620,
      "end_ms": 236725,
      "text": "叫澎拍板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00091",
      "start_ms": 238290,
      "end_ms": 240670,
      "text": "一九七零年八月三十日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00092",
      "start_ms": 240690,
      "end_ms": 243835,
      "text": "核潜艇反应堆首次达到满功率，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00093",
      "start_ms": 244420,
      "end_ms": 246185,
      "text": "整个深山都沸腾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00094",
      "start_ms": 247100,
      "end_ms": 252125,
      "text": "可总设计师彭士路已经连续五天五夜没合眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00095",
      "start_ms": 253250,
      "end_ms": 255035,
      "text": "消息传来的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00096",
      "start_ms": 255500,
      "end_ms": 258225,
      "text": "他靠在墙角直接昏睡了过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00097",
      "start_ms": 258670,
      "end_ms": 260305,
      "text": "同年十二月二十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00098",
      "start_ms": 260750,
      "end_ms": 266435,
      "text": "中国第一艘核潜艇下水四点六万个零部件全部国产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00099",
      "start_ms": 267470,
      "end_ms": 272005,
      "text": "中国成了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00100",
      "start_ms": 272570,
      "end_ms": 273410,
      "text": "西方大国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00101",
      "start_ms": 273410,
      "end_ms": 274995,
      "text": "那句再等二十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00102",
      "start_ms": 275450,
      "end_ms": 279580,
      "text": "被他和他的团队硬生生提前干成了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00103",
      "start_ms": 279620,
      "end_ms": 286715,
      "text": "可这背后是拿命换来一九七四年核潜艇最后调试阶段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00104",
      "start_ms": 287130,
      "end_ms": 288490,
      "text": "彭氏路突发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00105",
      "start_ms": 288510,
      "end_ms": 290725,
      "text": "魏川孔倒在了工位上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00106",
      "start_ms": 291700,
      "end_ms": 294200,
      "text": "医生切掉了他四分之三的胃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00107",
      "start_ms": 294700,
      "end_ms": 295460,
      "text": "从那以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00108",
      "start_ms": 295660,
      "end_ms": 297560,
      "text": "他兜里永远揣着胃药，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00109",
      "start_ms": 297840,
      "end_ms": 299060,
      "text": "疼的厉害了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00110",
      "start_ms": 299740,
      "end_ms": 300540,
      "text": "吞两片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00111",
      "start_ms": 301360,
      "end_ms": 302700,
      "text": "接着往工地上跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00112",
      "start_ms": 303720,
      "end_ms": 304860,
      "text": "八十八岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00113",
      "start_ms": 305520,
      "end_ms": 306600,
      "text": "有记者问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00114",
      "start_ms": 307800,
      "end_ms": 309000,
      "text": "当年值得吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00115",
      "start_ms": 310080,
      "end_ms": 312460,
      "text": "他说值得搞成功了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00116",
      "start_ms": 312640,
      "end_ms": 313540,
      "text": "特别高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00117",
      "start_ms": 313800,
      "end_ms": 314620,
      "text": "就是死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00118",
      "start_ms": 314760,
      "end_ms": 315820,
      "text": "也是值得的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00119",
      "start_ms": 316640,
      "end_ms": 321410,
      "text": "核潜艇搞成了他转身又去拓荒中国的核电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00120",
      "start_ms": 321730,
      "end_ms": 328470,
      "text": "大亚湾秦山中国核电站从无到有的每一步都踩着他的脚印。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00121",
      "start_ms": 328890,
      "end_ms": 330070,
      "text": "一九八三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00122",
      "start_ms": 330430,
      "end_ms": 333910,
      "text": "他任大亚湾核电站筹建总指挥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00123",
      "start_ms": 334650,
      "end_ms": 335290,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00124",
      "start_ms": 335590,
      "end_ms": 339590,
      "text": "我国外汇储备才一点六七亿美元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00125",
      "start_ms": 340090,
      "end_ms": 342170,
      "text": "大亚湾要四十亿美元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00126",
      "start_ms": 342910,
      "end_ms": 343670,
      "text": "钱不够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00127",
      "start_ms": 343870,
      "end_ms": 346830,
      "text": "他四处奔波筹资人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00128",
      "start_ms": 346850,
      "end_ms": 349050,
      "text": "没有他一点点带。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00129",
      "start_ms": 349950,
      "end_ms": 350450,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00130",
      "start_ms": 350450,
      "end_ms": 353165,
      "text": "他又任秦张二期核电站董事长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00131",
      "start_ms": 353920,
      "end_ms": 356485,
      "text": "从主要参数到投资方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00132",
      "start_ms": 356930,
      "end_ms": 357965,
      "text": "大到反应堆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00133",
      "start_ms": 358300,
      "end_ms": 359580,
      "text": "小到一颗螺丝钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00134",
      "start_ms": 359700,
      "end_ms": 360975,
      "text": "他都心中有数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00135",
      "start_ms": 361470,
      "end_ms": 366170,
      "text": "二零一七年九十二岁的他拿到一百万港币的科技大奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00136",
      "start_ms": 366250,
      "end_ms": 368005,
      "text": "一分钱没往家里拿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00137",
      "start_ms": 368370,
      "end_ms": 369905,
      "text": "权数捐给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00138",
      "start_ms": 370250,
      "end_ms": 372445,
      "text": "用来资助核工业的年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00139",
      "start_ms": 373500,
      "end_ms": 374655,
      "text": "女儿跟他开玩笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00140",
      "start_ms": 375610,
      "end_ms": 376685,
      "text": "留点给自己嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00141",
      "start_ms": 377560,
      "end_ms": 378445,
      "text": "他板起脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00142",
      "start_ms": 379630,
      "end_ms": 380865,
      "text": "这钱是国家的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00143",
      "start_ms": 381360,
      "end_ms": 382545,
      "text": "我一分都不能动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00144",
      "start_ms": 383720,
      "end_ms": 385100,
      "text": "二零二一年三月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00145",
      "start_ms": 385100,
      "end_ms": 387464,
      "text": "九十六岁的彭时路在北京离世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00146",
      "start_ms": 388240,
      "end_ms": 390660,
      "text": "他的遗嘱里没有半句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00147",
      "start_ms": 390740,
      "end_ms": 391235,
      "text": "家事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00148",
      "start_ms": 391570,
      "end_ms": 392695,
      "text": "只有一个心愿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00149",
      "start_ms": 393560,
      "end_ms": 395405,
      "text": "把我的骨灰撒进大海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00150",
      "start_ms": 395890,
      "end_ms": 397365,
      "text": "我要陪着核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00151",
      "start_ms": 397780,
      "end_ms": 399005,
      "text": "守着这片海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00152",
      "start_ms": 399460,
      "end_ms": 401275,
      "text": "临终前昏迷的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00153",
      "start_ms": 401650,
      "end_ms": 403230,
      "text": "他还在含糊的念叨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00154",
      "start_ms": 403270,
      "end_ms": 405320,
      "text": "参数核对好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00155",
      "start_ms": 405500,
      "end_ms": 406045,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00156",
      "start_ms": 406530,
      "end_ms": 409485,
      "text": "你听听都到生命的最后一口气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00157",
      "start_ms": 409910,
      "end_ms": 412385,
      "text": "他心里装的还是工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00158",
      "start_ms": 412820,
      "end_ms": 413855,
      "text": "他这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00159",
      "start_ms": 414230,
      "end_ms": 416565,
      "text": "小时候老百姓用命护他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00160",
      "start_ms": 417040,
      "end_ms": 417600,
      "text": "长大后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00161",
      "start_ms": 417600,
      "end_ms": 422595,
      "text": "他用命护国造核潜艇、建核电站两件大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00162",
      "start_ms": 423560,
      "end_ms": 426525,
      "text": "渐渐关系着咱们十四亿人的安稳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00163",
      "start_ms": 427830,
      "end_ms": 431295,
      "text": "你说这样的人是不是该被永远记住？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00164",
      "start_ms": 431760,
      "end_ms": 436565,
      "text": "觉得彭老了不起的评论区打深浅一生四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00165",
      "start_ms": 437380,
      "end_ms": 443175,
      "text": "致敬这位隐姓埋名一辈子的老人点亮小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00166",
      "start_ms": 443490,
      "end_ms": 444395,
      "text": "转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00167",
      "start_ms": 444840,
      "end_ms": 448345,
      "text": "让更多人知道今天我们能挺直腰杆说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00168",
      "start_ms": 448690,
      "end_ms": 450405,
      "text": "背后就是彭老这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00169",
      "start_ms": 451120,
      "end_ms": 453745,
      "text": "用一辈子在暗处给我们撑伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00170",
      "start_ms": 454330,
      "end_ms": 455110,
      "text": "点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00171",
      "start_ms": 455410,
      "end_ms": 456475,
      "text": "讲给孩子听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00172",
      "start_ms": 456750,
      "end_ms": 457295,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0b4fe2503841c930_s00173",
      "start_ms": 457670,
      "end_ms": 460675,
      "text": "往后咱们一起讲更多先辈的故事。"
    }
  ],
  "previous_context": [],
  "following_context": [],
